abstract: >
  A 0D lumped-parameter ODE model exploring whether heat or hypoxia
  dominates goldfish mortality in a sealed-room compartment fire —
  used as a vehicle for a broader case study in engineering
  verification methodology. Originates from a popular brain teaser
  and an observation that different LLMs gave inconsistent answers
  to it. The repository documents the full iterative process,
  including model bugs found and fixed, a circular-reasoning mistake
  in an early dimensionless-analysis attempt, and open questions
  that remain unresolved. This is a working draft, not an
  independently validated engineering conclusion — see
  article/article.md for the confidence table, validation log, and
  known limitations.
